sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Application
    participant Gateway as Platform Ingress<br/>Gateway API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HTTP as vllm-rocm Pod<br/>HTTP API<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as vllm-rocm Pod<br/>TGIS gRPC<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant GPU as AMD ROCm GPU<br/>Device Driver
    participant S3 as Model Storage<br/>S3 / PVC<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over HTTP,S3: Flow 2: Model Loading at Startup
        HTTP->>S3: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS IAM / storage credentials
        S3-->>HTTP: Model artifacts
        HTTP->>GPU: Load model to GPU memory<br/>Device driver
        Note over HTTP: Model ready for inference
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,GPU: Flow 1: Model Inference Request (HTTP)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Gateway->>RBAC: Forward request<br/>Auth validation
        RBAC->>HTTP: Proxy to inference<br/>HTTP/8000<br/>Pre-authenticated
        HTTP->>GPU: Inference computation<br/>PagedAttention
        GPU-->>HTTP: Tensor results
        HTTP-->>RBAC: JSON response
        RBAC-->>Gateway: Forward response
        Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS response<br/>TLS 1.2+
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,GPU: Flow 1: Model Inference Request (gRPC/TGIS)
        Client->>Gateway: gRPC GenerateRequest<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Gateway->>RBAC: Forward request<br/>Auth validation
        RBAC->>GRPC: Proxy to TGIS adapter<br/>gRPC/8033<br/>Pre-authenticated
        GRPC->>GPU: Inference computation<br/>vllm_tgis_adapter → vLLM engine
        GPU-->>GRPC: Tensor results
        GRPC-->>RBAC: GenerateResponse
        RBAC-->>Gateway: Forward response
        Gateway-->>Client: gRPC response<br/>TLS 1.2+
    end
